    "description": "The operation transforms ASCII bytes and leaves non-ASCII bytes unchanged for case conversion. Rotate moves exactly the first byte to the end.\n\nThe operation transforms ASCII bytes and leaves non-ASCII bytes unchanged for case conversion. Rotate moves exactly the first byte to the end.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.string.raw-bytes@1.\nExpected:\nresult (string) = \"AZ09!\"\n",
